{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d139d726-5e14-8eb7-a6a7-fa57a39ce4bc",
  "created_at": "2025-12-18T10:29:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Fatima Teixeira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:27:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities Division, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:27:50-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello, thank you. This is Fatima Teixeira. I got my water and sewer bill and it is very high. Very high. My pipe broke in the kitchen last month, the plumber fixed it, so this bill is wrong, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:28:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about the pipe. Is there a leak adjustment you're asking about? We do review those when a repair was made. Do you have the bill in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:28:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have it here. Okay. So the leak adjustment, I can ask for it now? Thank you. And there is a word here, 'consumption.' Consumption charge. What is this, consumption? I don't use so much, I live alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:28:28-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Consumption just means the amount of water that went through your meter in that billing period. So the number of units used, and the charge is based on that. If the pipe was leaking, the water still went through the meter, which is why the number is high."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:28:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah. So the water went out the pipe, but the meter counted it. Okay, okay. That is not fair, but I understand. So I need to ask for the adjustment, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:28:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. You'd send in the plumber's repair receipt, with your account number, and the billing office reviews it. I can note your call on the account today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:29:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, thank you. Please note it. Now, one more thing. It is due soon. Can I pay this online tonight? After City Hall is closed? I am home at night, I don't go out when it is dark and the rain today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:29:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the online payment page works any hour, so tonight is fine. You'd need the account number from the top of the bill. There's also a drop box outside if you'd rather bring it by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:29:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online, any hour, okay. Account number from the top. Good. And the receipt, I send the receipt from the plumber. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:29:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Can I get a callback number for the note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:29:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 401-555-0199. Oh, also, I must go pick up a framed photo this afternoon, so I'm out soon. It is waiting for me at the shop. Thank you very much, you are very kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:29:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Teixeira. Take care in the rain."
    }
  ],
